<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>403 - Akses Ditolak</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        body { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #f8fafc; }
        .error-wrap { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; }
        .error-code { font-size: 7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -3px; color: #e2e8f0; line-height: 1; }
        .error-title { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; color: #475569; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        .error-desc { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        .error-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 0.55rem 1.5rem; background: #3d4158; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s; }
        .error-btn:hover { background: #2e3147; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-wrap">
        <div class="error-code">403</div>
        <h1 class="error-title">Akses Ditolak</h1>
        <p class="error-desc">Kamu tidak punya izin untuk mengakses halaman ini.</p>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="error-btn">Kembali ke Dashboard</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
